WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.061 --> 00:00:11.377
Pip grabs the wand. "June must be close."

2
00:00:11.378 --> 00:00:17.004
The kids spot a road.

3
00:00:17.005 --> 00:00:21.050
"It's the road from the game," Jane says.

4
00:00:21.051 --> 00:00:29.833
Pip jumps onto a big tile. "Let's go!"

5
00:00:29.834 --> 00:00:41.480
The kids follow the road past cupcake trees.

6
00:00:41.481 --> 00:00:46.749
They come to a wide stream.

7
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:51.982
"The stream looks like mud," Jane says.

8
00:00:51.983 --> 00:01:11.357
Pip grins. "I think it's . . . cocoa!"

9
00:01:11.358 --> 00:01:18.458
"How can we cross?" Jane asks.

10
00:01:18.459 --> 00:01:25.482
"I see a boat over there," Pip says.

11
00:01:25.483 --> 00:01:34.152
"Let's take that."

12
00:01:34.153 --> 00:01:42.540
The kids get in the boat.

13
00:01:42.541 --> 00:01:45.792
"Row," Jane says.

14
00:01:45.793 --> 00:01:52.441
Pip groans. "You can row too."

15
00:01:52.442 --> 00:01:58.379
Jane sighs. "Fine."

16
00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:06.559
The kids row the boat.

17
00:02:06.560 --> 00:02:15.034
Jane looks in the stream. "Oh no!"

18
00:02:15.035 --> 00:02:20.483
Gray spots float on top of the cocoa.

19
00:02:20.484 --> 00:02:28.885
The spots grow into big shapes.

20
00:02:28.886 --> 00:02:39.583
Pip shakes with fright. "Slime monsters!"

21
00:02:39.584 --> 00:02:46.023
One grabs Jane's elbow.

22
00:02:46.024 --> 00:02:49.316
Fwip! Fwip! Arrows fly.

23
00:02:49.317 --> 00:02:52.983
The arrows hit the monsters.

24
00:02:52.984 --> 00:03:01.389
The monsters groan and fade away.

25
00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:07.958
"Who shot those arrows?" Jane asks.

26
00:03:07.959 --> 00:03:12.313
"Look!" Pip says.

27
00:03:12.314 --> 00:03:20.508
"There's a knight with a bow!"

